  "description": "In-memory test doubles (FakeLedgerClient, FakeAdminClient, FakePqsClient, FakeTokenProvider) and event/result builders for unit-testing business logic against the Canton Ledger API client surfaces without a live participant. No mocking framework required. Every fake implements a neutral Canton surface from Canton.Ledger.Abstractions — ICantonLedgerClient (and thus Daml.Ledger.Abstractions.ILedgerClient), IAdminClient, ITokenProvider and IPqsClient — so the package references only Canton.Ledger.Abstractions, Daml.Ledger.Abstractions and Daml.Runtime, dragging in neither transport nor PostgreSQL.",
